  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "We run a SaaS.",
      "section": "",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Customers register webhook endpoints; when things happen in our platform (order.created, order.paid, refund.issued, ...) we must deliver a signed JSON event to every endpoint subscribed to that event type.",
      "section": "",
      "modality": "must"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Customers manage endpoints via an admin HTTP API: create/list/delete endpoints, choose event types, rotate the signing secret.",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Internal services publish events through an internal API (HTTP or in-process call).",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Each event is delivered at least once to every matching endpoint. Deliveries are retried with exponential backoff (1 min, 5 min, 30 min, 2 h, 12 h; 5 attempts) on 5xx/timeout. 4xx (except 429) is final failure. 429 honours Retry-After.",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": "must"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Every delivery carries an HMAC-SHA256 signature over the body with the endpoint's current secret, plus a timestamp header; after rotation, both old and new secrets are valid for 24 h.",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Customers can see delivery attempts per event (status, response code, timestamps) and manually redeliver.",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Endpoints that fail continuously for 3 days are disabled automatically and the customer is notified by email.",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "1,000 events/s sustained publish rate, 5,000 endpoints; delivery latency p95 under 5 s for a healthy endpoint.",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "No event lost on process crash (persist before ack).",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Per-endpoint isolation: one slow endpoint must not delay others.",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": "must"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Ops: metrics (queue depth, delivery success rate, attempt latency) exposed for Prometheus; structured logs.",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Python 3.12, PostgreSQL available, Redis available. Single region. Team of 3.",
      "section": "constraint",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Must run as a set of stateless containers behind our existing ingress.",
      "section": "constraint",
      "modality": "must"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Records are retained for 90 days and audit history for 1 year, after which a nightly job deletes them (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Personal data is deleted on request within 30 days and access to it is logged (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "functional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Records are 2 KB on average and at most 256 KB (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Availability of 99.9 % monthly; accepted work is delayed but never lost during an outage (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": "must"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Backups run daily with a recovery point of 24 h and a recovery time of 4 h (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "An alert is raised when the error rate exceeds 1 % for 5 minutes or the queue depth grows for 10 minutes (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "nonfunctional",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "No existing data or system to migrate from (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "constraint",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Authentication by API keys per customer (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "constraint",
      "modality": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Use existing infrastructure only; no new managed services (assumed by the engine).",
      "section": "constraint",
